"af_bella|Good morning, Doctor! Welcome to Nome, and to your first day as a wildlife vet.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|Good morning, Doctor! Welcome to Nome, and to your first day as a wildlife vet.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_bella|Here\u2019s what the reserve\u2019s systems did overnight. The feeders switched the calves to their winter mix. The herd drones moved the herd away from a fox. And this barn tested its heaters.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|Here\u2019s what the reserve\u2019s systems did overnight. The feeders switched the calves to their winter mix. The herd drones moved the herd away from a fox. And this barn tested its heaters.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_bella|And one worry. Aqpik, a five-month-old woolly mammoth calf, hasn\u2019t nursed since yesterday morning. Her collar translator is 55% sure her mouth hurts.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|And one worry. Aqpik, a five-month-old woolly mammoth calf, hasn\u2019t nursed since yesterday morning. Her collar translator is 55% sure her mouth hurts.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_bella|Find out why she stopped eating, and decide what the reserve\u2019s machines may do about it. They act on their own. You set the rules, and you sign.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
