"af_nova|Collar translator, 55% sure: \u201cMy mouth hurts.\u201d":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"elder_woman|She hasn\u2019t nursed since yesterday morning. A calf her age drinks milk all day long. After about three days without it, she\u2019ll get weak.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"elder_woman|Maybe her mouth does hurt. Her milk tusks are close. But I\u2019ve watched calves teethe for twelve years. They fuss and rub their gums on everything. She doesn\u2019t.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"elder_woman|Go watch her yourself. Watch her feet, not just her face. Mammoths listen with their feet.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"elder_woman|Trust it like a smart friend who wasn\u2019t there. It\u2019s very good, but it only knows what its collar can sense.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
