"elder_woman|Today, that rule is yours to keep or change.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_liam|Hey, Doc. I\u2019m Eli Johnson. My I\u00f1upiaq name is Tuttu, after my great-grandpa. He herded reindeer on this same land.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_liam|My family\u2019s reindeer graze just east of your fence. It\u2019s the rut right now, so the bulls are jumpy. Your herd drones buzz along the fence every morning, and my reindeer scatter.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
