"bm_george|Byte\u2019s memo: Why won\u2019t Aqpik eat?":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Aqpik is a five-month-old woolly mammoth calf. She still drinks her mother\u2019s milk many times a day.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|She has not nursed or eaten since yesterday morning, about 24 hours ago.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|A calf her age gets weak after about three days without milk, so we have until Sunday morning.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Before looking at her clues, I start with the base rate: how often each cause happens in calves her age.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|In 100 young calves that stopped eating, about 40 had sore mouths from new teeth, 25 had upset bellies, 20 were scared, and 15 were sick.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Her collar translator reads her sounds and body language. It is 55% sure her mouth hurts.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Her milk tusks should come in soon, and that can make her gums sore.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|So my forecast is: sore mouth 55%, upset belly 20%, scared 15%, sick 10%.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Updated: a hum too low for her collar to hear comes from the east ridge every few minutes, and Aqpik freezes each time. My new forecast is: scared 60%, sore mouth 20%, upset belly 12%, sick 8%.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Each cause has its own cheap test that takes one day.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|A full exam needs sedation and costs 400 coins, and about 3 in 100 calves have trouble breathing under it.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|If she still has not eaten by Sunday at 6 AM, the care system will sedate her on its own.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Collar translator: Aqpik\u2019s last 24 hours":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|The collar listens to her rumbles and squeaks. Its motion sensors track her ears, trunk, head, and legs.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Ears held out wide and stiff, 31 times: \u201cI\u2019m alert\u201d (70%).":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Stopped chewing in the middle of a bite, 9 times: \u201cMy mouth hurts\u201d (55%).":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Trunk curled up under her chin: \u201cI\u2019m worried\u201d (60%).":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Lifted a front foot and held it still: \u201cMy foot is sore?\u201d (30%).":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|Most of these happen together, every few minutes. I could not find what starts them.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|My microphones cannot hear sounds lower than 20 hertz, about the lowest sounds people can hear.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|My confidence numbers are my best guesses, not facts.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"bm_george|I do not learn on the job. My maker sends updates, and the reserve must approve each one.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
